{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8Ujb5WEPXXB9ukWibe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4177,"cache_read_input_tokens":52588,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4177},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f37443be-bb4c-4d74-8485-15439a47e629","uuid":"80cd3135-588e-4f27-a597-3966f00bcb2d","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:21:40.377Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8UjHyHs7LzkE7nWiVk","thinking_duration_ms":1810,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8Ujb5WEPXXB9ukWibe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014LzxaemMDxt9xrZCnKNTqP","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-001-OMAV6p/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>山隅烘焙所 · 独立咖啡烘焙工作室</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"山隅烘焙所是一间小批量烘焙的独立咖啡工作室，每周烘豆，到店可试饮、可买豆。\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\">山隅烘焙所<small>Shanyu Roastery</small></a>\n      <nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\">\n        <a href=\"#beans\">豆单</a>\n        <a href=\"#philosophy\">烘焙理念</a>\n        <a href=\"#visit\">到店</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"top\">\n\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div>\n          <h1>每周烘一次，<br><span>只烘你喝得完的量。</span></h1>\n          <p class=\"hero-lead\">我们是一间只有一台 6 公斤烘豆机的小工作室。每批豆子烘好后静置三到五天，杯测合格才上架，从出炉到你手里不超过两周。</p>\n          <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-solid\" href=\"#beans\">看本周豆单</a>\n            <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#visit\">来店里坐坐</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <aside class=\"roast-log\" aria-label=\"最近一次烘焙记录\">\n          <h2>最近一炉</h2>\n          <dl>\n            <dt>日期</dt><dd>10 月 24 日，周五</dd>\n            <dt>豆子</dt><dd>埃塞俄比亚 耶加雪菲 孔加</dd>\n            <dt>投豆</dt><dd>4.2 kg，出豆 3.6 kg</dd>\n            <dt>时长</dt><dd>9 分 40 秒，一爆后 1 分 25 秒下豆</dd>\n            <dt>上架</dt><dd>10 月 28 日起</dd>\n          </dl>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section beans\" id=\"beans\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>本季豆单</h2>\n          <p>每款 200 克起售，店内可免费试饮</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <ul class=\"bean-list\">\n          <li class=\"bean bean-featured\">\n            <div class=\"bean-name\">\n              <h3>耶加雪菲 孔加</h3>\n              <p class=\"bean-origin\">埃塞俄比亚 · 水洗 · 原生种</p>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"bean-notes\">茉莉花、柠檬皮、红茶，放凉后有蜂蜜般的回甘。</p>\n            <span class=\"bean-roast\" data-level=\"light\">浅烘</span>\n            <span class=\"bean-price\">¥98 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"bean\">\n            <div class=\"bean-name\">\n              <h3>慧兰 粉红波旁</h3>\n              <p class=\"bean-origin\">哥伦比亚 · 水洗 · 粉红波旁</p>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"bean-notes\">荔枝、白葡萄、蔗糖，酸质明亮但不尖锐。</p>\n            <span class=\"bean-roast\" data-level=\"light\">浅中烘</span>\n            <span class=\"bean-price\">¥118 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"bean\">\n            <div class=\"bean-name\">\n              <h3>涅里 AA</h3>\n              <p class=\"bean-origin\">肯尼亚 · 水洗 · SL28 / SL34</p>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"bean-notes\">黑醋栗、番茄、葡萄柚，厚实多汁，适合手冲。</p>\n            <span class=\"bean-roast\" data-level=\"mid\">中浅烘</span>\n            <span class=\"bean-price\">¥108 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"bean\">\n            <div class=\"bean-name\">\n              <h3>保山 日晒卡蒂姆</h3>\n              <p class=\"bean-origin\">中国云南 · 日晒 · 卡蒂姆</p>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"bean-notes\">葡萄干、黑糖、烤杏仁，加奶也不会被盖住。</p>\n            <span class=\"bean-roast\" data-level=\"mid\">中烘</span>\n            <span class=\"bean-price\">¥68 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"bean\">\n            <div class=\"bean-name\">\n              <h3>拾柴拼配</h3>\n              <p class=\"bean-origin\">巴西 × 云南 · 意式用豆</p>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"bean-notes\">可可、榛果、焦糖，做拿铁、澳白都稳定。</p>\n            <span class=\"bean-roast\" data-level=\"dark\">中深烘</span>\n            <span class=\"bean-price\">¥78 <small>/ 250g</small></span>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <p class=\"bean-footnote\">豆单随产季更换。所有豆子都标注烘焙日期，买回去建议在烘焙后 7 到 30 天内喝完。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section philosophy\" id=\"philosophy\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>烘焙理念</h2>\n          <p>我们相信的几件小事</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"measure-prose\">\n          <ol class=\"principles\">\n            <li>\n              <h3>先尝生豆，再决定怎么烘</h3>\n              <p>每支新豆子到店，我们会用三条不同的曲线各烘一小锅，盲测之后再定下最终方案。同一个产区的豆子，今年和去年的烘法也可能不一样。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>烘得浅一点，把产地的味道留下来</h3>\n              <p>单品豆大多停在浅烘到中烘之间。我们想让你喝出埃塞的花香、肯尼亚的莓果酸，而不是千篇一律的焦苦。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>小批量，每周都新鲜</h3>\n              <p>每周四、五烘豆，每炉不超过 5 公斤。卖完就等下一炉，不囤货，也不提前烘好放着。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>每一炉都留记录</h3>\n              <p>温度曲线、环境湿度、杯测分数都存档。你买到的每一袋豆子，我们都能说出它是哪一天、哪一炉烘出来的。</p>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n\n          <blockquote class=\"quote\">\n            <p>好的烘焙，是让人忘了烘焙这回事，只记得这杯咖啡。</p>\n            <footer>—— 主理人 阿岩</footer>\n          </blockquote>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>到店</h2>\n          <p>工作室就是门店，烘豆的时候整条巷子都是香的</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"visit-block\">\n            <h3>地址</h3>\n            <address class=\"visit-address\">杭州市西湖区满觉陇路 37 号<br>山隅烘焙所（巷口有木牌）</address>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"visit-block\">\n            <h3>营业时间</h3>\n            <ul class=\"hours\">\n              <li><span>周二至周五</span><span>10:00 – 18:00</span></li>\n              <li><span>周六、周日</span><span>9:30 – 19:00</span></li>\n              <li><span>周一</span><span>店休</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"visit-block\">\n            <h3>怎么来</h3>\n            <ol class=\"route\">\n              <li>公交 Y3 路、4 路到“满觉陇”站，下车步行约 3 分钟。</li>\n              <li>自驾可停在满觉陇停车场，再步行约 5 分钟。</li>\n            </ol>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <aside class=\"visit-note\">\n          <h3>来之前可以知道</h3>\n          <p>店里只有八个座位，周末下午可能要稍等一会儿。</p>\n          <p>每周六上午 10 点有免费杯测，一次 6 人，可以在店里或电话预约。</p>\n          <p>买豆可以请我们现场按你的器具研磨，也可以带自己的密封罐来装。</p>\n          <p>电话：0571-8888 0000</p>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <p>© 2026 山隅烘焙所</p>\n      <p>小批量烘焙 · 每周新鲜出炉</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4177,"cache_read_input_tokens":52588,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4177},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f37443be-bb4c-4d74-8485-15439a47e629","uuid":"29c75a38-1f68-497b-b4f7-c764d41c3108","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:22:10.174Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8UjHyHs7LzkE7nWiVk","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_014LzxaemMDxt9xrZCnKNTqP":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-001-OMAV6p/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>山隅烘焙所 · 独立咖啡烘焙工作室</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"山隅烘焙所是一间小批量烘焙的独立咖啡工作室，每周烘豆，到店可试饮、可买豆。\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class